### 3. **Smart Intent Detection**

#### Priority Order:
```
0. Category/Brand Intent ⭐ HIGHEST
   ↓
1. Multi-criteria Search
   ↓
2. Product Comparison
   ↓
3. Specific Product Search
   ↓
...
```

#### Logic Flow:

```csharp
private ChatbotResponse ProcessIntent(string message)
{
    // Priority 0: Check Category or Brand Intent
    var categoryOrBrandResponse = CheckCategoryOrBrandIntent(message);
    if (categoryOrBrandResponse != null)
    {
        return categoryOrBrandResponse; // ✅ Return immediately
    }

    // Continue with other intents...
    if (IsMultiCriteriaSearch(message))
    {
        return ProcessMultiCriteriaSearch(message);
    }
    
    // ... other intents
}
```

