## URL Patterns

### Category URL:
```
/san-pham?danhmuc={BiDanh hoặc Id}

Examples:
/san-pham?danhmuc=dien-thoai
/san-pham?danhmuc=5
```

### Brand URL:
```
/san-pham?thuonghieu={BiDanh hoặc Id}

Examples:
/san-pham?thuonghieu=samsung
/san-pham?thuonghieu=apple
/san-pham?thuonghieu=3
```

